# ============================================================================
#  e-Pili Bomba Kunak — V2 STAGING security response headers
#
#  This file is copied into dist/ by Vite (anything in v2/public/ is) and is
#  read by Cloudflare Pages, which applies these headers to every response.
#
#  WHY THIS IS SEPARATE FROM THE ROOT _headers
#    The root /_headers belongs to V1 and is what officers get today. It must
#    not be touched by the migration. This one belongs to the V2 bundle, and
#    it is deliberately STRICTER — see below.
#
#  THE ONE REAL DIFFERENCE: script-src has no 'unsafe-inline'.
#    V1 needs it because the whole app is an inline <script> in index.html.
#    V2 is a bundle, so the allowance can go — proved by tests/v2-csp.js, which
#    boots the real built app under exactly this policy and fails on a single
#    CSP violation or page error. This is the security improvement the
#    migration buys, and it is the reason not to copy V1's header across
#    unchanged at cutover.
#
#  UNCHANGED FROM V1, AND MUST STAY THAT WAY
#    geolocation=(self) is required by "Guna Lokasi Saya" in Tambah Pili.
#    Setting it back to geolocation=() silently disables that button with no
#    error message at all.
#
#    No CDN appears in script-src. Leaflet, markercluster and the Supabase
#    client are bundled from npm at versions pinned to exactly what V1
#    vendors. A third-party script would run with full access to the signed-in
#    session and to every record card.
#
#  STAGING-ONLY: X-Robots-Tag.
#    Staging must never be indexed. It carries real hydrant data and real
#    officer logins, and a search result pointing at it is a support incident
#    waiting to happen. Remove this line at cutover — and only then.
# ============================================================================

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tile.openstreetmap.org https://*.tile.openstreetmap.org https://isxfhocfkjamjchmicwq.supabase.co; connect-src 'self' https://isxfhocfkjamjchmicwq.supabase.co wss://isxfhocfkjamjchmicwq.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
